Changelog: 26-10-2026 03:19:06

Added. platform: terminal_command() and launch_in_terminal() take keep_open="on_error" (owner, 26-10-2026): the
"Press Enter" pause comes only when the command failed, so a terminal whose command ended well closes by itself; the
exit file gets the status either way. The portal uses it for installs and uninstalls.

